Error [E0905]: `T` isn't `Decode`
  --> tests/ui/db_decode_unbound_param.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     db.decode<T>(row)
    |        ^^^^^^
 Why: Type parameter `T` doesn't declare the `Decode` bound, so a caller may choose a type without it
 Fix: Declare the bound where `T` is introduced: `<T: Decode>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0905
